<title>LATVIA: APRIL CAR REGISTRATIONS RISE.</title>
<headline>APRIL CAR REGISTRATIONS RISE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in Latvia rose to 1,239 units in April from March's 884 units and 745 units in April 1996, the Latvian Motorvehicle Traders Association said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The rise in car sales of 355 units compared with a rise between February and March of 371 units.</p>
<p>The car with the most sales so this year to end April was again the Russian-made VAZ, which has sold 176 units versus 146 in March.</p>
<p>The Second most popular was Toyota at 109 versus 80 and Renault at 109 versus 76.</p>
<p>The sales for the fourth months of the year compared with total 1996 sales of 2,538 units.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
